From 32b1b355c1a4cb9f62ba2c1db287d7114172f778 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Krishodari <kishodari21@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 05:54:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Implement pm62 (diff) and pm63 (activate) for rate card
 lookup
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

pm62: services/product/ratecard/diff-versions.ts — in-memory, read-only
diff of a version against the card's current ACTIVE, bucketed into
added/changed/removed. Adds two read-only repository functions
(getAllRowsForVersion, getCurrentActiveRows) to hit the two-query
budget, and reuses pm58's shared row-key delimiter instead of a second
literal.

pm63: services/product/ratecard/activate-version.ts +
actions/product/activate-ratecard-version.action.ts — one transaction,
locks the target DRAFT (new findVersionForUpdate repo read) and the
outgoing ACTIVE, computes the diff inside the transaction, promotes/
demotes with no lookup-row writes, and records one
RATECARD_VERSION_ACTIVATED audit event with the superseded id and diff
counts. Full audit-type ripple (types, category map, filter test).

Also fixes two pre-existing, unrelated guardrail failures found while
verifying this change (confirmed red on dev1 before this commit): the
audit-log-import boundary check was missing the ratecard write
services, and a stale "0041 is the only ratecard migration" assertion
didn't account for pm61's legitimate 0043 migration.

